{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Just click Spawn buttons!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >just spawn attackers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then it will automatically attack the enemies that are rushing in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't forget to upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Get Rewards!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions, spin the slot machine!, and get rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins to get permanent upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803680/extras/4b6b0b34461528067075e0c72e8656b2.avif?t=1755539327\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Test your luck!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When spawning an attacker, its level is randomly determined and hidden may appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Especially hidden has a good ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Analyze!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze why you couldn't clear the level through the statistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803680/extras/56ca3b9e081c12642d62c3d1c090dae4.avif?t=1755539327\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Luck isn't always necessary.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden is spawned according to probability, but you can increase the hidden chance, and if you spawn a certain number of hiddens through probability adjustment, hidden is unconditionally spawned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The effectiveness of the attacker can be increased through appropriate upgrades.</p>","achievemen